-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">gddrshgresrs</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">gddrshgresrs</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">gddrshgresrs</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">gddrshgresrs</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">gddrshgresrs</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">gddrshgresrs</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">gddrshgresrs</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">gddrshgresrs</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">gddrshgresrs</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">gddrshgresrs</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">gddrshgresrs</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">gddrshgresrs</span><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">gddrshgresrs</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"bjh-p\"><span class=\"bjh-strong\" style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"bjh-p\"><span class=\"bjh-strong\" style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">立即撤销逮捕令！</span></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"bjh-p\">12月8日和9日，是北京今年入冬以来最寒冷的一个周末。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"bjh-p\">这两天，中国外交部副部长乐玉成格外忙碌。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"bjh-p\">由他出面代表中国政府两次紧急召见驻华大使，后来被媒体纷纷以“重磅”消息密集报道。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"bjh-p\">被召见人，则分别是加拿大驻华大使麦家廉和美国驻华大使布兰斯塔德。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; font-family: arial;\"><img style=\"width: 1022px;\" src=\"http://speak.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com//articles/20181211/P7qDkSvtaTUtbV8ORKyZGzPPLYj9BpWaxfrOhGXQ.jpeg\"><span class=\"bjh-p\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"bjh-p\">从外交部网站的消息中，小锐发现，在召见两位大使时，乐玉成副部长均提到了下列8个字：严正交涉，强烈抗议。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"bjh-p\">在对美加拘押孟晚舟女士事件的定性上，乐玉成副部长两次亦都作出如下表态：“严重侵犯中国公民的合法、正当权益”，“性质极其恶劣”。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"bjh-p\">值得注意的是，在中方两次紧急召见的表态中，处处可见强烈的警示意味。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"bjh-p\">8日，中方强烈敦促加方立即释放被拘押人员，切实保障当事人的合法、正当权益。否则必将造成严重后果，加方要为此承担全部责任。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"bjh-p\">9日，乐玉成要求美方，立即采取措施纠正错误做法，撤销对中国公民的逮捕令。中方将视美方行动作出进一步反应。</span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-align: justify; font-family: arial;\"><span class=\"bjh-p\">用词不可谓不重，警告意味不可谓不清晰。</span></p>', 'articles/cover/20181211/df37df636a6387a131419aff6aa2dda3.jpg', '2018-12-11 19:09:06', '1', null, '1', '2018-12-11 19:03:30', '2018-12-12 13:35:14', null, '0');
